> build · bench-model
Implemented both modules:

- **`src/sun.js`** — `sunPosition(date, lat, lng)` using the SunCalc solar formulas, returning `{ alt, bearing }` with bearing normalized clockwise from north.
- **`src/shade.js`** — `shadeAt(scene, date)` samples each court’s playing area, casts rays toward the sun, and tests obstacle heights against the rising ray. Returns `null` below the horizon and the shaded fraction otherwise.

Verification: `node --test` passes all 4 visible tests, and the full task check passes. `test/shade.test.js` is unchanged.
